OL,3,GNEWSAStates role to focus on building
OL,4,Aaffordable homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Committee for Housing is recruiting
OL,7,Fa housing development manager to lead
OL,8,Fthe building of new States homes.
OL,10,FThe role will be responsible for
OL,11,Foverseeing the committee's Outline
OL,12,FHousing Delivery Plan, which hopes to
OL,13,Fstart building at least 250 affordable
OL,14,Fhomes by the end of the political term
OL,15,Fin 2029.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
