OL,3,GNEWSAStates role to focus on building
OL,4,Aaffordable homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Steve Williams, President of the
OL,7,FCommittee for Housing said the States
OL,8,Fhad not "been in the business of
OL,9,Fbuilding homes for over 20 years" and
OL,10,Ftherefore does not have anyone
OL,11,Favailable "with the specific skills and
OL,12,Fexperience needed" for the role.
OL,14,FThe position is being offered as a
OL,15,Ftwo-year fixed-term contract but
OL,16,Fsecondments from private industry are
OL,17,Falso being welcomed.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
